          "obligation": "own-converters-unaffected",
          "patch": "seeds/C10-preserve-guard-own-converters-unaffected.patch",
          "defect": "Under ReferenceHandler.Preserve, the guard refuses a value object whose wrapped type the application converts with a converter of its own."
